  "question_stem": "Over a period of time Julian finds that on long-distance flights he flies economy class on $82\\%$ of flights. On the rest of the flights he flies first class. When he flies economy class, the probability that he gets a good night's sleep is $x$. When he flies first class, the probability that he gets a good night's sleep is $0.9$.",
